    Returns an output of type: number
- get_fx_effect_pct_tool: Return the FX-translation impact as a decimal fraction.
    Takes inputs: {'segment_id': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Internal numeric ID of the segment.'}, 'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Fiscal year whose reported figures include the FX impact.'}, 'effect_basis': {'type': 'string', 'nullable': True, 'description': 'Defines how the percentage is calculated.  For this scenario we need "prev_year_sales" which expresses the impact as a percentage of the prior-year sales.  Defaults to that value.'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
