    Takes inputs: {'prev_year_sales_mil': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'The previous year’s sales value in millions.'}, 'fx_pct': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Decimal fraction representing FX impact (*e.g.* 0.02 for 2 %).'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
