    Takes inputs: {'reported_sales_mil': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Reported sales amount in millions of USD.'}, 'fx_absolute_mil': {'type': 'number', 'description': 'Absolute FX component to be removed (millions).'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
