    Takes inputs: {'segment_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Human-readable segment name.'}}
    Returns an output of type: array
- get_quarterly_sales_tool: Return quarterly sales for a segment (mainly a decoy).
    Takes inputs: {'segment_name': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Human-readable name of the business segment.'}, 'year': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Fiscal year (e.g. 2008).'}, 'quarter': {'type': 'integer', 'description': 'Quarter number (1 to 4).'}}
    Returns an output of type: number
- final_answer: Provides a final answer to the given problem.
    Takes inputs: {'answer': {'type': 'any', 'description': 'The final answer to the problem'}}
    Returns an output of type: any

